      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ZIPPING URBAN (4) goes very well here starting 20 times for seven wins and four minors. Recorded a 5 length win (29.58) in a Free For All last time at this track. Looks a leading chance on best. STAR TURN (1) isn't a quick beginner but comes home hard, finishing out of the frame two back but did wind up strongly to place when third (30.11) in a Free For All at this track. Has a good record here including six wins. The form out of last race has been strong. Expected to feature. HERA ROLEX (5) is a smart dog who took advantage of a low draw and cleared the ruck early, tearing away with an all the way win (25.22) at Q Lakeside in Grade 5 over 457m. Has a strong winning record at this journey. Recorded the quickest time on the card last start. Expected to feature again. CANYA AURORA (8) scored in impressive time last start. Right in the mix.",
